---
// Content migrated verbatim from the original monolithic index.html.
---
<section id="testimonials" class="testimonials-section">
    <!-- PREMIUM ENHANCEMENT: leaf watermark, right-alternating this time. -->
    <div class="leaf-watermark leaf-right" data-depth="0.5" style="top:2%; right:-11%;" aria-hidden="true">
        <picture><source srcset="/leaf.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/leaf.png" alt="" loading="lazy"></picture>
    </div>


    <div class="testi-header" data-reveal="soft-rise">
        <div class="testi-tag">
            <picture><source srcset="/IMG.2.webp" type="image/webp"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/IMG.2.PNG" alt="leaf"></picture> CLIENT LOVE
        </div>
        <h2 class="testi-headline">The Freshness We Have Served</h2>
        <div style="width:50px;height:2px;background:rgba(45,82,60,0.25);margin:16px auto 20px;border-radius:2px;"></div>
        <p class="testi-sub">Real stories from real clients who trusted us to grow their brand and saw real results.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="testi-carousel-wrap" data-reveal="paper-unfold">
        <div class="testi-track-outer">
            <div class="testi-track" id="testiTrack">

                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <div class="testi-card active">
                    <div class="testi-card-top">
                        <div class="testi-avatar-wrap">
                            <div class="testi-avatar-placeholder">P</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi-quote-icon">"</div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testi-body">Mint Marketing India has done a great job managing our social media and creating engaging content. Their organic strategies and Meta Ads have helped us generate quality leads and bring more enquiries. The team is creative, professional, and understands our brand really well. Highly recommended!</p>
                    <div class="testi-divider"></div>
                    <div class="testi-name">Pragyendra Gupta</div>
                    <div class="testi-role">Pro Ultimate Gym, Nirala Nagar and Gomti Nagar</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div class="testi-card">
                    <div class="testi-card-top">
                        <div class="testi-avatar-wrap">
                            <div class="testi-avatar-placeholder">B</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi-quote-icon">"</div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testi-body">Working with Mint Marketing India has been a great experience. They helped us grow our Instagram following significantly and turn our social media presence into real business results. We’ve noticed increased store visits and sales. Really impressed with their creativity and consistency!</p>
                    <div class="testi-divider"></div>
                    <div class="testi-name">Baleegh Ahmad</div>
                    <div class="testi-role">Aqsa Beauty Collection</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div class="testi-card">
                    <div class="testi-card-top">
                        <div class="testi-avatar-wrap">
                            <div class="testi-avatar-placeholder">Z</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi-quote-icon">"</div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testi-body">Really happy with Mint Marketing India’s work. The content they’ve created for our salon has been amazing. We’ve reached new audiences, and many people have discovered our salon through Instagram and started visiting us. Great work by the team!</p>
                    <div class="testi-divider"></div>
                    <div class="testi-name">Zubair Sheikh</div>
                    <div class="testi-role">Habib Salon</div>
                </div>

            </div><!-- /testi-track -->
        </div><!-- /testi-track-outer -->

        <div class="testi-nav">
            <button class="testi-btn" id="testiBtnPrev" aria-label="Previous">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
            <div class="testi-dots" id="testiDots"></div>
            <button class="testi-btn" id="testiBtnNext" aria-label="Next">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

